OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing away this evening then dry
OL,7,Fwith clear periods. Thickening cloud
OL,8,Fwill bring some light and patchy rain
OL,9,Ffrom the west later in the night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FPatchy rain soon clearing.
OL,12,FThen it will be dry with some
OL,13,Fbrightness developing during the
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAfter
OL,17,Fa mainly dry start scattered showers
OL,18,Fdeveloping by afternoon. Dry on
OL,19,FThursday, rain spreading east later.
OL,20,FEarly rain on Friday, then becoming
OL,21,Fdry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
